│                                                                                                                                                                   │
│   Help: BigMem Memory                                                                                                                                             │
│                                                                                                                                                                   │
│                                                                                                                                                                   │
│  Browse persistent memories stored in BigMem. Each entry is a decision, bug fix, discovery, or convention saved automatically by the orchestrator or sub-agents.  │
│                                                                                                                                                                   │
│                                                                                                                                                                   │
│  Keyboard Shortcuts                                                                                                                                               │
│                                                                                                                                                                   │
│                                                                                                                                                                   │
│    R  — Load memories from BigMem                                                                                                                                 │
│    ↑↓  — Navigate memory list                                                                                                                                     │
│    ENTER  — View memory details                                                                                                                                   │
│    ESC  — Back to list / main menu                                                                                                                                │
│                                                                                                                                                                   │
│                                                                                                                                                                   │
│  Press ? or ESC to close help                                                                                                                                     │
│                                                                                                                                                                   │
